| **High λ variability** | Aerogel agglomeration or poor sonication coupling | Re‑run SOP‑02 Phase C; verify probe amplitude & pulse duty cycle | CV > 5% across 3 subsamples |
| **Low compressive strength** | Incomplete carbonation or high w/b ratio | Extend CO₂ cure to 21 days; verify RH > 65% in chamber | f_c < 1.5 MPa at Day 14 |
| **PCM leakage after cycling** | Shell rupture during mixing or thermal subcooling | Reduce mixer speed ≤ 50 rpm; pre‑warm PCM to 28°C; switch to melamine‑silica hybrid shell | Visible exudation > 2% after 20 cycles |
| **Surface efflorescence** | Excess free lime + moisture migration | Reduce water content by 0.5%; add 2–3% metakaolin/pozzolan | Crusting > 0.5 mm thickness |
| **Poor MBV (< 1.2)** | Over‑dense matrix or excessive vibration compaction | Increase hemp fraction by 3–5%; reduce vibration to 20 sec | MBV fails 2 consecutive batches |
| **DSC baseline drift** | Incomplete N₂ purge or pan seal failure | Verify gas flow (50 mL/min); replace hermetic seal; run empty pan baseline | ΔH error > 5% on indium reference |
| **Phenolphthalein test shows pink core** | Poor CO₂ diffusion or tray overcrowding | Increase tray spacing to 50 mm; add low‑velocity internal fan | Carbonation depth < 75% at Day 14 |

